  "description": "EST. JAN 10, 2026\n\nMYTHICAL is a semi-casual IdleMMO guild focused on steady progress, teamwork, and good vibes. We welcome active players who enjoy growing stronger together without hardcore pressure. Whether you’re grinding, chatting, or just idling your way to greatness, you’ve got a place here. Legends aren’t rushed—they’re built.\n\n📢 ALWAYS READ THE GUILD ANNOUNCEMENTS AND BULLETIN BOARD\n\nLEADER - ACENIXZ\n\nDEPUTIES \n \n \n\n📝REQUIREMENTS:\n- 3 days inactivity = kick\n- 3 days no guild activity = kick\n\n⏰RAID SCHEDULE:\n   - CL 40 : 9:00 PM (UTC +8)\n\n🎯GUILD FOCUS:\n\n- DONATE TO THE STOCKPILE \n    - MYSTIC BAR\n    - MYSTICAL LOGS\n    - MAHOGANY LOGS\n    - CHROMITE BAR\n   \n\n- BUILDINGS TO UNLOCK\n  - \n\n\n📋GUILD BULLETIN BOARD:\n  - ALL MEMBERS ARE REQUIRED TO DONATE OR PARTICIPATE IN ANY GUILD ACTIVITIES. GUILD RAIDS, GUILD CHALLENGES. \n  - ALL MEMBERS ARE ENCOURAGED TO INCREASE THEIR COMBAT LEVEL.",
